{"type":"message","id":"a8d36be5","parentId":"28774666","timestamp":"2026-03-02T03:55:40.827Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-9871381e0e704f68acdff5dd4aa093a7","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.26 (bc50708) — Greetings, Professor Falken\n\nUsage: openclaw gateway call [options] <method>\n\nCall a Gateway method\n\nArguments:\n  method                 Method name (health/status/system-presence/cron.*)\n\nOptions:\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --params <json>        JSON object string for params (default: \"{}\")\n  --password <password>  Gateway password (password auth)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"10000\")\n  --token <token>        Gateway token (if required)\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1432,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.26 (bc50708) — Greetings, Professor Falken\n\nUsage: openclaw gateway call [options] <method>\n\nCall a Gateway method\n\nArguments:\n  method                 Method name (health/status/system-presence/cron.*)\n\nOptions:\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --params <json>        JSON object string for params (default: \"{}\")\n  --password <password>  Gateway password (password auth)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"10000\")\n  --token <token>        Gateway token (if required)\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772423740824}}
{"type":"message","id":"f43a3616","parentId":"a8d36be5","timestamp":"2026-03-02T03:55:43.824Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我需要找到如何 spawn 子 agent 的方法。看起来 openclaw 命令行没有直接的 spawn 子命令。让我检查一下 openclaw agent 命令和 subagents 相关功能。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-73ce27b52a524c97abecc7beffc2edc4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw agent --help"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":206,"output":100,"cacheRead":11633,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11939,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772423740827}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0a4e810","parentId":"f43a3616","timestamp":"2026-03-02T03:55:45.313Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-73ce27b52a524c97abecc7beffc2edc4","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.26 (bc50708) — Chat automation for people who peaked at IRC.\n\nUsage: openclaw agent [options]\n\nRun an agent turn via the Gateway (use --local for embedded)\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>               Agent id (overrides routing bindings)\n  --channel <channel>        Delivery channel:\n                             last|telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|feishu|nostr|msteams|mattermost|nextcloud-talk|matrix|bluebubbles|line|zalo|zalouser|synology-chat|tlon\n                             (omit to use the main session channel)\n  --deliver                  Send the agent's reply back to the selected channel\n                             (default: false)\n  -h, --help                 Display help for command\n  --json                     Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  --local                    Run the embedded agent locally (requires model\n                             provider API keys in your shell) (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>       Message body for the agent\n  --reply-account <id>       Delivery account id override\n  --reply-channel <channel>  Delivery channel override (separate from routing)\n  --reply-to <target>        Delivery target override (separate from session\n                             routing)\n  --session-id <id>          Use an explicit session id\n  -t, --to <number>          Recipient number in E.164 used to derive the\n                             session key\n  --thinking <level>         Thinking level: off | minimal | low | medium | high\n  --timeout <seconds>        Override agent command timeout (seconds, default\n                             600 or config value)\n  --verbose <on|off>         Persist agent verbose level for the session\n\nExamples:\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"status update\"\n    Start a new session.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Summarize logs\"\n    Use a specific agent.\n  openclaw agent --session-id 1234 --message \"Summarize inbox\" --thinking medium\n    Target a session with explicit thinking level.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Trace logs\" --verbose on --json\n    Enable verbose logging and JSON output.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Summon reply\" --deliver\n    Deliver reply.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Generate report\" --deliver --reply-channel slack --reply-to \"#reports\"\n    Send reply to a different channel/target.\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agent"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1481,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.26 (bc50708) — Chat automation for people who peaked at IRC.\n\nUsage: openclaw agent [options]\n\nRun an agent turn via the Gateway (use --local for embedded)\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>               Agent id (overrides routing bindings)\n  --channel <channel>        Delivery channel:\n                             last|telegram|whatsapp|discord|irc|googlechat|slack|signal|imessage|feishu|nostr|msteams|mattermost|nextcloud-talk|matrix|bluebubbles|line|zalo|zalouser|synology-chat|tlon\n                             (omit to use the main session channel)\n  --deliver                  Send the agent's reply back to the selected channel\n                             (default: false)\n  -h, --help                 Display help for command\n  --json                     Output result as JSON (default: false)\n  --local                    Run the embedded agent locally (requires model\n                             provider API keys in your shell) (default: false)\n  -m, --message <text>       Message body for the agent\n  --reply-account <id>       Delivery account id override\n  --reply-channel <channel>  Delivery channel override (separate from routing)\n  --reply-to <target>        Delivery target override (separate from session\n                             routing)\n  --session-id <id>          Use an explicit session id\n  -t, --to <number>          Recipient number in E.164 used to derive the\n                             session key\n  --thinking <level>         Thinking level: off | minimal | low | medium | high\n  --timeout <seconds>        Override agent command timeout (seconds, default\n                             600 or config value)\n  --verbose <on|off>         Persist agent verbose level for the session\n\nExamples:\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"status update\"\n    Start a new session.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Summarize logs\"\n    Use a specific agent.\n  openclaw agent --session-id 1234 --message \"Summarize inbox\" --thinking medium\n    Target a session with explicit thinking level.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Trace logs\" --verbose on --json\n    Enable verbose logging and JSON output.\n  openclaw agent --to +15555550123 --message \"Summon reply\" --deliver\n    Deliver reply.\n  openclaw agent --agent ops --message \"Generate report\" --deliver --reply-channel slack --reply-to \"#reports\"\n    Send reply to a different channel/target.\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agent","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772423745310}}
